-		<English>When a unit owned by a non-hostile civ has moved, and that civ has fewer units in the destination tile than this threshold, then the [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Show Friendly Moves[COLOR_REVERT] option (Ctrl+O screen) ignores the move. As the moving unit is included in the count, a threshold of [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]1[COLOR_REVERT] corresponds to the BtS behavior of showing all moves - except that AdvCiv always excludes worker moves and some other uninteresting moves. The threshold has no effect when [COLOR_HIGHLIGHT_TEXT]Show Friendly Moves[COLOR_REVERT] isn't enabled.</English>
